>-: Please type in something.
>-: 
	You are in space.


A planet is nearby.
>-: 
	You are orbiting a tropical planet.


>-: 
	You are approaching an island.
Coconut palms, sword ferns, orchids, and other lush vegetation drape this
jagged island carved seemingly from pure emerald and set in a turquoise
sea. The land rises sharply behind you. There is a nice beach left.

>-: 
	You are flying over the beach.
A warm gentle surf caresses the white coral beach here. The land rises
sharply left. The beach is lost in low cliffs and rocks ahead.

>-: You are down.

	This is a beautiful coral beach.
Fine silver sand kissed lightly by warm tropical waters stretches at least
30 meters here from the ocean to under gently swaying palms left.

There is a Viper ready for launch here.
>-: The amulet begins to glow.
A light mist falls over your eyes and the sound of purling water trickles in
your ears.   When the mist lifts you are standing beside a cool stream.

	You are on the bank of a stream.
The stream falls over several small boulders here and continues on ahead.

>-: 
	The thermal pools flow into a stream here.
The gurgling hot waters pour over boulders into a swiftly flowing
stream behind you. The pools are ahead.

>-: 
	You are at the thermal pools.
Several steaming fumaroles and spluttering geysers drenched by icy mountain
waters from a nearby waterfall heat half a dozen natural pools to a
delicious 42 degrees. Enchantingly beautiful singing seems to flow from the
water itself as it tumbles down the falls. There is a mossy entrance
to a cave ahead.

A flower-like young goddess is bathing in the hot mineral pools. She is 
watching you, but continues to steep and sing softly.
>-: She offers a delicate hand, and you help her out of the sparkling springs.
Water droplets like liquid silver bedew her golden skin, but when they part
from her, they fall as teardrops.  She wraps a single cloth around her and
ties it at the waist.  Around her neck hangs a golden amulet.
She bids you to follow her, and walks away.
>-: The goddess leads you down a steamy tunnel and into a high, wide chamber.
She sits down on a throne.

	You are in a rather large chamber.
Beds of ferns and palm leaves make several cozy nests along the walls. In the
center of the room is a throne of gold and silver which pulls out into a bed
of enormous size.  A passageway ahead leads down.

A kerosene lantern is burning luridly here.
The goddess is reclining on a bed of ferns and studying you intently.
>-: Kissed.
She squirms and avoids your advances.
>-: Kissed.
She is coming around; she didn't fight it as much.
>-: She cuddles up to you, and her mouth starts to work:
'That was my sister's amulet.  The lovely goddess, Purl, was she.  The Empire
captured her just after the Darkness came.  My other sister, Vert, was killed
by the Dark Lord himself.  He took her amulet and warped its power.
Your quest was foretold by my father before he died, but to get the Dark Lord's
amulet you must use cunning and skill.  I will leave you my amulet,
which you may use as you wish.  As for me, I am the last goddess of the
waters.  My father was the Island King, and the rule is rightfully mine.'

She pulls the throne out into a large bed.
Her kisses revive you; your wounds are healed.

Goddess:
Loved.
>-: It's too dark to see anything in here!
>-: 
	You are just inside the cave.
A steamy hot breath is belching from the depths of the earth within. The
cave  continues back.

>-: 
	You are at the entrance to a cave.
A tall narrow fissure in the rock cliffs here has become a well traveled
passage way. A hoof beaten dirt path leads directly into it. A curl of
steam is trailing from a corner of the fissure's gaping mouth. The path
leads ahead and back. The pools are right.

>-: 
	You are on a dirt trail.
The trail seems to start here and head ahead. High cliffs border the 
trail left.

>-: 
	You are on a dirt path along the wash.
This path looks more like a deer trail. It scampers away left.

>-: 
	The trail is lost in the woods here.
I suppose the animals that use this trail all depart in different directions
when they get this far into the woods. The trail goes back.

>-: 
	You are on a dirt road.
The road continues ahead and back.

>-: 
	You are on a dirt road.
The road winds through a coconut grove here. The road continues on ahead
and back.

>-: 
	You are on a dirt road.
The road winds through a coconut palm grove here. It continues on ahead 
and back.

There are some coconuts here.
>-: 
	You are on a dirt road.
There is a large village ahead. The road cleaves a coconut plantation behind you.
A small dirt road goes right, and a driveway peels off left.

>-: 
	This is the front lawn.
There is a small fountain here where the driveway meets the lawn.
Across the driveway, right, is an ornate white house with and elegant 
woodworking.  The bargeboards are carved with fylfots, the ancient 
symbols of luck.  Even a bell tower has been built here.  There is a 
road behind you which turns into the driveway.

>-: 
	You are on the front porch of the cottage.
Several giggling native girls came running down the steps as you approached
and headed on down the road.  On the fern rimmed porch is a small table with
matching white wrought iron chairs cushioned with red velvet.  The front
door leads ahead.  The lawn and fountain are behind you.

>-: 
	You are in the drawing room.
Exquisitely decorated with plants and antique furniture of superb
craftsmanship, the parlor reflects its owner's impeccable taste.  The tropical
sun is streaming in through open shutters behind you.  There doesn't seem 
to be anybody around.  A large immaculate oaken desk is visible in the
study and it even has a old fashioned telephone to complete the decor.

There is an unwieldy two-handed sword here.
There is a colorful pink potion in a small crystal vial here.
>-: You are now wearing a laser.
>-: You are now wearing a knife.
>-: You are now wearing an amulet.
>-: two-handed sword:
Taken.
>-: potion:
Taken.
