>-: Out from the shadows a figure leaps!  His black cape swirls around, and he
holds a laser sword at your chest.  'So, you have come to fulfill the Quest.
Ha! Your weapons are no match for me!'
<fight!>-: Clutching his blood drenched shirt, he collapses stunned.
He attacks...
I'm afraid you have suffered a broken leg and torn ligaments.
<fight!>-: You smite him to the ground.
But in a flurry of steel he regains his feet!
He attacks...
I'm afraid you have suffered a minor puncture wound.
<fight!>-: He throws you back against the rock and pummels your face.
Lifting the amulet from you, he flees down the dark caverns.
It's too dark to see anything in here!
>-: The Dark Lord leaps away and runs down secret tunnels and corridors.
You chase him through the darkness and splash in pools of water.
You have cornered him.  His laser sword extends as he steps forward.
<fight!>-: You escape stunned and disoriented from the fight.
A victorious bellow echoes from the battlescene.
It's too dark to see anything in here!
>-: The cool liquid runs down your throat but turns to fire and you choke.
The heat reaches your limbs and tingles your spirit.  You feel like falling
asleep.
